<% content_for :title, "Tim Whitacre" %>
<% content_for :description, "I help organizations turn ambitious ideas into reality, from AI strategy and implementation to full-stack architecture that actually ships" %>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="mb-32">
  <h1 class="mb-6 leading-13">
    I help organizations turn ambitious ideas into reality, from AI strategy and implementation to full-stack architecture that actually ships.
  </h1>
</section>

<!-- About Section -->
<section class="mb-32">
  <h2>About</h2>

  <div class="space-y-6">
    <p>
      I'm an entrepreneur and software engineer based in Kansas City. I'm currently building Hopeware to help organizations increase their technology effectiveness. Previously, I led technology at New Story, where we built the world's first 3D-printed community—a project that caught Apple's attention for a documentary.
    </p>

    <p>
      I love ideating and building. Over my career, I've launched numerous projects (with 3 acquisitions), co-authored Code School Book to help bootcamp grads break into tech, and even run a beard oil company called Beard Shine. With a background in counseling and two decades of software engineering, I bring both technical depth and people skills to everything I build. If you want to work together or just chat about ideas, hit me up.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

